ions Integration - Sightings Search workflow","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/secops-integration-sightings-search-workflow.md","line":62},{"title":"Sightings","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/sightings-searches-in-misp.md","line":70},{"title":"Sightings Search Details","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/view-sightings-search-details.md","line":70},{"title":"Sightings Search Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/view-sightings-search-results.md","line":70},{"title":"MISP integration for Security Operations","target":"misp-integration-for-security-operations","line":136},{"title":"Review the MISP user role and permissions","target":"misp-user-roles-and-permissions","line":146},{"title":"Sightings","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/sightings-searches-in-misp.md","line":201},{"title":"Sightings Search Details","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/view-sightings-search-details.md","line":201},{"title":"Sightings Search Results","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/view-sightings-search-results.md","line":201},{"title":"Review the MISP user role and permissions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/misp-user-roles-and-permissions.md","line":209},{"title":"Security Operations Integration - Sightings Search Flow","target":"secops-integration-sightings-search-workflow","line":276},{"title":"View Sightings Search Results","target":"view-sightings-search-results","line":277},{"title":"View Sightings Search Details","target":"view-sightings-search-details","line":278},{"title":"Using MISP to investigate and analyze threats","target":"using-misp-to-detect-and-analyze-threats","line":279},{"title":"Configure MISP sighting searches","target":"configure-sightings-search","line":280},{"title":"Review the MISP integration settings","target":"review-the-misp-integration-settings","line":281},{"title":"MISP user roles and permissions","target":"misp-user-roles-and-permissions","line":282},{"title":"Observables","target":"c_Observables","line":283},{"title":"Sightings","target":"indicator-sightings","line":284},{"title":"Campaign","target":"campaign","line":285},{"title":"Security Operations","target":"security-operations-landing-page","line":286},{"title":"Run Sighting Search","target":"tisc-run-sighting-search","line":287},{"title":"MISP integration for Security Operations","target":"misp-integration-for-security-operations","line":288}],"metadata":{"title":"Sighting searches in MISP","description":"You can perform sighting searches on observables in the MISP instance to determine how often certain types of attacks, such as phishing attacks or communications with a malicious IP or URL, occur in your network. Each occurrence is considered a sighting.Enable the sighting search in MISP to run automatically so that the Security Operations Integration - Sightings Search workflow is triggered whenever new observables are associated with a security incident.Select individual or multiple observables and perform a manual sighting search in the ServiceNow AI Platform MISP integration for Security Operations application to determine the prevalence of a threat over time.Report threat data sightings so that you can react to false positives in your data and increase your awareness when a true positive threat occurs. You can also add an expiration date for a particular observable or attribute.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/sightings-searches-in-misp.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":9,"breadcrumb":["Using MISP to investigate and analyze threats","MISP integration for Security Operations","Threat Intelligence integrations","Threat Intelligence","Enterprise security case management applications","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/sightings-searches-in-misp.md"},
